{"seq":2,"slug":"selection-crossbreeding","title":"大学动物科学 — 选择与杂交育种","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/agriculture/animal-science/animal-genetics-breeding/selection-crossbreeding","wordCount":1717,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"大学动物科学-选择与杂交育种\">大学动物科学 — 选择与杂交育种</h1><h2 id=\"知识要点\">知识要点</h2><p>掌握了遗传规律之后，育种者手里就有了两件改良畜群的核心工具：<strong>选择</strong>和<strong>杂交</strong>。选择是&quot;优中选优、代代积累&quot;——把最好的个体留作种用，让优良基因在群体中越来越普遍，这是一个缓慢但持久的纯系改良过程。杂交则是&quot;取长补短、立竿见影&quot;——让不同品种交配，利用杂种优势在一代之内就获得超越双亲的表现。</p>\n<p>这两件工具的逻辑截然不同却相辅相成。选择像存钱，靠的是长期复利，慢慢把品种的遗传水平垫高；杂交像投资组合，靠的是不同品种基因的&quot;化学反应&quot;，一次性兑现优势。现代畜牧业几乎都是&quot;专门化品系选育 + 终端杂交利用&quot;的组合拳——先用选择培育出各有所长的纯系，再用杂交把它们的优点合到商品代身上。理解这套组合，你就看懂了市场上绝大多数肉猪、肉鸡是怎么来的。</p>\n<h2 id=\"详细讲解\">详细讲解</h2><h3 id=\"选择-育种的-复利引擎\">选择：育种的&quot;复利引擎&quot;</h3><p>选择的本质是改变群体的基因频率：让好基因更常见，坏基因更稀少。按选择依据可分几类：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>个体选择</strong>：直接看个体自身表现，适合高遗传力性状（如生长速度）。</li>\n<li><strong>家系选择</strong>：参考家系（兄弟姐妹）的平均表现，适合低遗传力或难以个体度量的性状（如屠宰才能测的肉质）。</li>\n<li><strong>后裔测定</strong>：通过后代表现来评判种畜，准确但耗时——一头种公牛要等女儿们产奶后才知道它好不好，世代间隔长达数年。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>当需要同时改良多个性状时，常用<strong>选择指数</strong>——把各性状按经济重要性和遗传参数加权求和，得到一个综合分数：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>b</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><msub><mi>P</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>b</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi>P</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mo>⋯</mo><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>b</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><msub><mi>P</mi><mi>n</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I = b_1 P_1 + b_2 P_2 + \\cdots + b_n P_n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\">⋯</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>按这个指数排序选种，能在多个目标间取得最优平衡。现代育种已发展出更精密的 BLUP（最佳线性无偏预测）方法，能综合所有亲属信息估计个体的真实育种值，是当今种猪、奶牛遗传评估的行业标准。</p>\n<h3 id=\"近交-双刃剑\">近交：双刃剑</h3><p>让亲缘关系近的个体交配叫<strong>近交</strong>。近交会提高纯合度，可以固定优良性状、暴露并淘汰隐性有害基因（用于培育纯系），但过度近交会导致<strong>近交衰退</strong>——生活力、繁殖力和生产性能下降。这就是为什么自然界和育种实践都极力避免近亲繁殖，而商业生产更倾向于利用其反面：杂交。</p>\n<h3 id=\"杂交与杂种优势\">杂交与杂种优势</h3><p>**杂种优势（Heterosis）**是指杂交后代在某些性状上超过双亲平均值的现象，正好是近交衰退的镜像。它可以量化为：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>H</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><msub><mi>F</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>ˉ</mo></mover><mo>−</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>P</mi><mo>ˉ</mo></mover></mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>P</mi><mo>ˉ</mo></mover></mfrac><mo>×</mo><mn>100</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">H(\\%) = \\frac{\\bar{F_1} - \\bar{P}}{\\bar{P}} \\times 100\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">%</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.2072em;vertical-align:-0.7101em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.4971em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.2899em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8201em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2523em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1667em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˉ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8201em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2523em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.25em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˉ</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8201em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2523em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1667em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˉ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7101em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">100%</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><msub><mi>F</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>ˉ</mo></mover></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\bar{F_1}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9701em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8201em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2523em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.25em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˉ</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是杂交后代均值，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>P</mi><mo>ˉ</mo></mover></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\bar{P}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8201em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8201em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2523em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1667em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˉ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是双亲均值。繁殖和生活力等低遗传力性状的杂种优势尤为显著，可达 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>10</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi><mtext>-</mtext><mn>30</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">10\\%\\text{-}30\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">10%</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">-</span></span><span class=\"mord\">30%</span></span></span></span></span>。</p>\n<p>杂种优势的应用催生了几种经典杂交模式：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>杂交方式</th>\n<th>做法</th>\n<th>特点</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>二元杂交</td>\n<td>A♀ × B♂</td>\n<td>利用个体杂种优势</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>三元杂交</td>\n<td>(A×B)♀ × C♂</td>\n<td>母本也是杂种，叠加母体杂种优势</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>轮回杂交</td>\n<td>多品种轮流回交</td>\n<td>持续保持杂种优势</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"经典案例-三元杂交商品猪\">经典案例：三元杂交商品猪</h3><p>走进任何一家现代养猪场，你看到的育肥猪几乎都是&quot;杜长大&quot;三元杂交猪。这是动物育种最成功的产业实践之一：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[长白 Landrace ♀&lt;br/&gt;繁殖力强] --&gt; C[长大母猪 LY&lt;br/&gt;母本杂种优势]&#10;    B[大白 Yorkshire ♂&lt;br/&gt;产仔多生长快] --&gt; C&#10;    C --&gt; E[杜长大商品猪 DLY&lt;br/&gt;生长快瘦肉率高]&#10;    D[杜洛克 Duroc ♂&lt;br/&gt;生长快肉质好] --&gt; E\">flowchart TD\n    A[长白 Landrace ♀&lt;br/&gt;繁殖力强] --&gt; C[长大母猪 LY&lt;br/&gt;母本杂种优势]\n    B[大白 Yorkshire ♂&lt;br/&gt;产仔多生长快] --&gt; C\n    C --&gt; E[杜长大商品猪 DLY&lt;br/&gt;生长快瘦肉率高]\n    D[杜洛克 Duroc ♂&lt;br/&gt;生长快肉质好] --&gt; E</pre><p>每个品种各司其职：长白和大白作母系，贡献繁殖力和母性；杜洛克作父系（终端公猪），贡献生长速度和瘦肉率。最终的商品猪 DLY 同时拥有&quot;母猪能生、肉猪能长&quot;的双重优势，且充分利用了杂种优势带来的生活力提升。这套体系把每个品种的长处都用到了刀刃上，是&quot;专门化品系 + 终端杂交&quot;思想的完美体现。</p>\n<h3 id=\"配套系-把杂交工业化\">配套系：把杂交工业化</h3><p>现代家禽和养猪业更进一步，发展出<strong>配套系</strong>——由育种公司将多个高度专门化的纯系按固定模式配套，形成稳定的商业杂交产品。比如肉鸡领域的&quot;AA&quot;&quot;罗斯 308&quot;，蛋鸡领域的&quot;海兰&quot;&quot;罗曼&quot;，都是配套系的代表。养殖户买的不是某个品种，而是一整套经过精密设计、性能稳定可预期的杂交体系。育种公司则牢牢掌握着核心纯系——这正是种业被称为畜牧业&quot;芯片&quot;的原因。</p>\n<h2 id=\"练习与思考\">练习与思考</h2><ol>\n<li>比较选择和杂交两种育种手段的逻辑差异。为什么说选择像&quot;存钱&quot;、杂交像&quot;投资组合&quot;？</li>\n<li>什么是后裔测定？为什么它准确却耗时？这与上一节讲的&quot;世代间隔影响育种速度&quot;如何呼应？</li>\n<li>解释近交衰退和杂种优势为什么是&quot;一枚硬币的两面&quot;。</li>\n<li>详细说明&quot;杜长大&quot;三元杂交中，长白、大白、杜洛克三个品种各承担什么角色，最终商品猪为何同时具备繁殖和生长优势。</li>\n<li>为什么说种业是畜牧业的&quot;芯片&quot;？配套系商业模式如何让育种公司掌握核心竞争力？</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"拓展阅读\">拓展阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>了解 BLUP 育种值估计方法的提出者亨德森，以及它如何革新了奶牛遗传评估。</li>\n<li>查阅中国地方猪种（如太湖猪、金华猪）的特点，思考如何在杂交体系中利用本土品种的优良基因。</li>\n<li>阅读全球种猪、种鸡育种公司（如 PIC、海兰国际）的商业模式，理解种业的产业格局。</li>\n<li>思考玉米杂交种（杂交水稻、杂交玉米）的成功，与动物杂交育种在原理上的共通之处。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>选择和杂交是育种者的两大核心工具：选择靠长期积累慢慢提升群体遗传水平，杂交靠杂种优势在一代内兑现超越双亲的表现。要掌握选择指数与 BLUP 如何综合多性状信息、近交衰退与杂种优势的镜像关系，以及&quot;专门化品系 + 终端杂交&quot;的产业逻辑——三元杂交商品猪和配套系正是这一逻辑的经典落地。下一节，我们将看分子生物学如何给这套延续百年的育种体系装上&quot;加速器&quot;——分子育种与基因组技术。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"大学动物科学 — 选择与杂交育种","id":"大学动物科学-选择与杂交育种"},{"level":2,"text":"知识要点","id":"知识要点"},{"level":2,"text":"详细讲解","id":"详细讲解"},{"level":3,"text":"选择：育种的\"复利引擎\"","id":"选择-育种的-复利引擎"},{"level":3,"text":"近交：双刃剑","id":"近交-双刃剑"},{"level":3,"text":"杂交与杂种优势","id":"杂交与杂种优势"},{"level":3,"text":"经典案例：三元杂交商品猪","id":"经典案例-三元杂交商品猪"},{"level":3,"text":"配套系：把杂交工业化","id":"配套系-把杂交工业化"},{"level":2,"text":"练习与思考","id":"练习与思考"},{"level":2,"text":"拓展阅读","id":"拓展阅读"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"大学动物科学 — 遗传学基础与数量性状","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/agriculture/animal-science/animal-genetics-breeding/genetics-fundamentals"},"next":{"title":"大学动物科学 — 分子育种与基因组技术","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/agriculture/animal-science/animal-genetics-breeding/molecular-breeding"}}